  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n32 ∶ 8 ∶∶ 72 ∶ 12 ∶∶ 128 ∶ ?\n\n**Logic: First number = [(Second number)² ÷ 2]**\n\n32 : 8 →\n\n⇒ [(8)² ÷ 2]\n\n⇒ (64 ÷ 2) = 32\n\n72 : 12 →\n\n⇒ [(12)2 ÷ 2]\n\n⇒ (144 ÷ 2) = 72\n\nSimilarly, for '128 : ?' →\n\n⇒ 128 = [(y)² ÷ 2]\n\n⇒ (y)² = (128 × 2)\n\n⇒ (y)2 = 256\n\n⇒ y = **16**\n\nHere, **'128 : 16'** is the correct pair.\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option (2)\".**\n\n2f:T931,\n<",
